  "selector": ".appt-preview",
  "description": "Getting ready to join an in-app video appointment: the preview of you (your own video), mute and camera buttons and Join Appointment, with the microphone and camera permission prompts, no microphone (Join is off until it is on; a tooltip says what to do), no camera (you can still join), access blocked (the phone’s notice with Settings), video paused (a weak signal) and unable to join (Try Again).",
